of your special diskettes, and somehow go from there through the serial
port with Kermit.  Or maybe you can read your disks on a MicroPDP11.
Also there is the Pro-350 which might read them (I don't know if the
Pro and the Micro are compatible.  I know I couldn't boot a Micro RT11
floppy in a Pro).

