Documentation for DEC RISC workstation hardware may be obtained via
FTP.  Connect to "gatekeeper.dec.com" (username "anonymous"; give your
own name for a password) and change to directory "/pub/DEC/specs".
(There are other interesting files in "/pub/DEC"; in particular, the
directory "/pub/DEC/TriAdd" contains a lot of information on the
TurboChannel bus.)

The files are all stored as compressed PostScript files.  You must
